{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"202786","name":"Xenophon Hotel","description":"Xenophon Hotel is a well-established 4-star hotel in Athens, combining decades of hospitality experience with a renewed vision for the future. Conveniently located with direct access to the National Highway and within easy reach of the city's public transportation network, including metro, train, bus and trolley services, the hotel offers seamless access to Athens’ historic centre, major attractions, business districts and key points of interest. Having welcomed visitors from around the world for many years, Xenophon Hotel has become a trusted choice for both leisure and business travellers. The hotel also holds a special place in Athens’ modern history, having served as an official hotel during the 2004 Olympic Games. The property features 185 guestrooms and one suite, each with a private balcony, while many rooms enjoy views of the Acropolis, Lycabettus Hill and the Athens skyline. As part of its ongoing commitment to enhancing the guest experience, an entire floor of Superior Rooms has been fully renovated in recent years, while the brand-new Deluxe Rooms have recently been introduced, offering a refreshed accommodation experience with contemporary design and enhanced comfort. This marks the beginning of a broader renewal programme currently underway throughout the hotel. Further upgrades are planned for both guestrooms and public areas, including developments that will strengthen the property's conference and event facilities in the years ahead. At the heart of Xenophon Hotel lies a genuine commitment to Greek hospitality. Supported by an experienced and dedicated team, the hotel continues to provide attentive service and a welcoming atmosphere, ensuring a comfortable and memorable stay for every guest visiting Athens.","address":"Acharnon 340","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"111 45 GR","lat":38.01477,"lng":23.72852,"stars":3,"giataCode":"262162","phone":"0